<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><document id="166979" schemaversion="1.4" type="glossary" date="2026-09-25T15:00:06+10:00" version="current" level="processed" position="1" publicationid="ebl1-syst-port-3u4v"><documentinfo><uri id="166979" external="false" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml" documenttype="glossary" created="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" modified="2026-09-25T15:00:06+10:00" scheme="http" host="pr.localhost" port="80" path="/ps/epub/local1/documents/system_report/components/definitions.psml" decodedpath="/ps/epub/local1/documents/system_report/components/definitions.psml" title="Definitions"><displaytitle>Definitions</displaytitle></uri><reversexrefs><reversexref uriid="167013" href="../system_report.psml" frag="content" urititle="System Report" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml" documenttype="references" id="719617" title="" type="none" forwardtype="embed" forwardtitle="undefined" forwarddisplay="document" forwardfrag="default" level="1"/></reversexrefs></documentinfo><fragmentinfo structure-modified="2026-09-25T14:59:09+10:00"><locator id="304399" fragment="166979-3" editid="816539" modified="2026-09-25T15:00:06+10:00"/><locator id="304400" fragment="166979-4" editid="816538" modified="2026-09-25T15:00:06+10:00"/><locator fragment="166979-1" modified="2019-09-10T14:32:08+10:00"/><locator fragment="166979-2" modified="2019-09-17T10:34:24+10:00"/></fragmentinfo><metadata/><section id="166979-title"><fragment id="166979-1"><heading level="1" numbered="true" prefix="1.1" id="166979-1-1-1">Definitions</heading></fragment></section><section id="166979-introduction"><fragment id="166979-3"><para>This is the glossary.</para></fragment></section><section id="166979-definitions" title="Definitions - will be inserted here"><xref-fragment id="166979-definitions" type="definitions"><blockxref uriid="167029" frag="default" type="transclude"><document id="167029" schemaversion="1.4" type="definition" date="2026-09-09T15:02:40+10:00" version="current" level="processed"><documentinfo><uri id="167029" external="false" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml" documenttype="definition" created="2026-09-09T15:02:40+10:00" modified="2026-09-09T15:02:40+10:00" scheme="http" host="pr.localhost" port="80" path="/ps/epub/local1/documents/definitions/berlioz.psml" decodedpath="/ps/epub/local1/documents/definitions/berlioz.psml" title="Berlioz"><displaytitle>Berlioz</displaytitle><labels>definition</labels></uri></documentinfo><fragmentinfo><locator fragment="167029-3" modified="2019-09-17T09:38:28+10:00"/></fragmentinfo><metadata/><section id="167029-title"><fragment id="167029-1">
      <heading level="1">Berlioz</heading>
    </fragment></section><section id="167029-content"><fragment id="167029-3"><para>Berlioz is an open source Java library, written by the PageSeeder team to provide a simple developer framework that uses URI template notation to allocate services and XSLT for serving XML to the web as HTML.</para></fragment></section></document></blockxref><blockxref uriid="166983" frag="default" type="transclude"><document id="166983" schemaversion="1.4" type="definition" date="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" version="current" level="processed"><documentinfo><uri id="166983" external="false" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml" documenttype="definition" created="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" modified="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" scheme="http" host="pr.localhost" port="80" path="/ps/epub/local1/documents/definitions/defect_rating.psml" decodedpath="/ps/epub/local1/documents/definitions/defect_rating.psml" title="Defect rating"><displaytitle>Defect rating</displaytitle><description>Categorised in terms of minor, significant, and critical bugs: the requirement(s) must define what is meant by a 'critical' bug (e.g., complete loss of data, complete inability to use certain parts of the functionality of the system).</description><labels>definition</labels></uri></documentinfo><fragmentinfo/><metadata/><section id="166983-title"><fragment id="166983-1">
      <heading level="1">Defect rating</heading>
    </fragment></section><section id="166983-content"><fragment id="166983-3">
      <para>Categorised in terms of minor, significant, and critical bugs: the requirement(s) must define what is meant by a 'critical' bug (e.g., complete loss of data, complete inability to use certain parts of the functionality of the system).</para>
    </fragment></section></document></blockxref><blockxref uriid="166978" frag="default" type="transclude"><document id="166978" schemaversion="1.4" type="definition" date="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" version="current" level="processed"><documentinfo><uri id="166978" external="false" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml" documenttype="definition" created="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" modified="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" scheme="http" host="pr.localhost" port="80" path="/ps/epub/local1/documents/definitions/non-functional.psml" decodedpath="/ps/epub/local1/documents/definitions/non-functional.psml" title="Non-functional"><displaytitle>Non-functional</displaytitle><description>Anything not related to the visible functionality.</description><labels>definition</labels></uri></documentinfo><fragmentinfo><locator fragment="166978-3" modified="2019-09-17T09:43:11+10:00"/></fragmentinfo><metadata/><section id="166978-title"><fragment id="166978-1">
      <heading level="1">Non-functional</heading>
    </fragment></section><section id="166978-content"><fragment id="166978-3"><para>Anything not related to the visible functionality (e.g. the system must be implemented using <xref href="#167029" uriid="167029" frag="default" type="none" config="definition" documenttype="glossary" display="manual" title="Berlioz">Berlioz</xref>).</para></fragment></section></document></blockxref><blockxref uriid="167002" frag="default" type="transclude"><document id="167002" schemaversion="1.4" type="definition" date="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" version="current" level="processed"><documentinfo><uri id="167002" external="false" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml" documenttype="definition" created="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" modified="2026-09-09T15:02:39+10:00" scheme="http" host="pr.localhost" port="80" path="/ps/epub/local1/documents/definitions/system_report.psml" decodedpath="/ps/epub/local1/documents/definitions/system_report.psml" title="System Report"><displaytitle>System Report</displaytitle><description>Aka SR describes the external behavior of the application or subsystem identified</description><labels>definition</labels></uri></documentinfo><fragmentinfo><locator fragment="167002-2" modified="2019-09-10T13:37:04+10:00"/><locator fragment="167002-3" modified="2019-09-10T13:33:48+10:00"/></fragmentinfo><metadata/><section id="167002-title"><fragment id="167002-1">
      <heading level="1">System Report</heading>
    </fragment></section><section id="167002-content"><fragment id="167002-3"><para>Aka SR describes the external behavior of the application or subsystem identified.</para></fragment></section></document></blockxref><blockxref uriid="167032" frag="default" type="transclude"><document id="167032" schemaversion="1.4" type="definition" date="2026-09-09T15:02:40+10:00" version="current" level="processed"><documentinfo><uri id="167032" external="false" mediatype="application/vnd.pageseeder.psml+xml" documenttype="definition" created="2026-09-09T15:02:40+10:00" modified="2026-09-09T15:02:40+10:00" scheme="http" host="pr.localhost" port="80" path="/ps/epub/local1/documents/definitions/system_requirements.psml" decodedpath="/ps/epub/local1/documents/definitions/system_requirements.psml" title="System Requirements"><displaytitle>System Requirements</displaytitle><labels>definition</labels></uri></documentinfo><fragmentinfo><locator fragment="167032-3" modified="2019-09-13T13:54:10+10:00"/></fragmentinfo><metadata/><section id="167032-title"><fragment id="167032-1">
      <heading level="1">System Requirements</heading>
    </fragment></section><section id="167032-content"><fragment id="167032-3"><para>Describes the external requirements of the application or subsystem identified.</para></fragment></section></document></blockxref></xref-fragment></section><section id="166979-content"><fragment id="166979-4"><para>The end of the glossary.</para></fragment></section></document>